[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14951.269, "timestamp": "04:09:11", "text": "我姐姐真的很壞。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14954.469, "timestamp": "04:09:14", "text": "我真的很擔心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14957.71, "timestamp": "04:09:17", "text": "我比任何人都更了解由紀的才能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14959.8, "timestamp": "04:09:19", "text": "。 你甚至有可能贏得他人的尊重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14963.52, "timestamp": "04:09:23", "text": "你甚至有可能贏得他人的尊重。 有。如果她選擇了那樣的未來，我姐姐就會…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14975.67, "timestamp": "04:09:35", "text": "那才是真正的你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14978.59, "timestamp": "04:09:38", "text": "啊，啊，美羽小姐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14983.309, "timestamp": "04:09:43", "text": "2"}]